ArkTs-X: experimental cross-platform ArkTS port and reproduction kit
Copyright 2026 KoalaHao

Based on OpenHarmony ArkCompiler Runtime Core and ETS Frontend.
Upstream: https://github.com/openharmony/arkcompiler_runtime_core
          https://github.com/openharmony/arkcompiler_ets_frontend

This repository distributes macOS modifications as patches against the exact
upstream commits in source-revisions.json. Patches retain upstream copyright
headers. Changes are described in native/PORTING.md. No upstream endorsement
is implied. Upstream source and third-party dependencies are fetched separately;
their own LICENSE, NOTICE and copyright files remain in their checkouts and
continue to apply. See the dependency manifest in runtime_core/static_core.

